- **The Bear is still the must-answer threat** — 4 damage/turn ends me in 4 swings. My only clean answer is Airbender's Reversal on a future attack (needs 3 mana: two generic + Hideout's {1},{T} for white).\n\
- Earth Rumble's fight can't kill a 4/4 (my biggest creature is 2 power), so it can't answer the Bear — best it could do is trade an animated land into The Earth King.\n\
- Playing Mountain unlocks Zuko later (Hideout makes black, Mountain makes red), and more untapped lands strengthens the Reversal bluff.\n\
\n\
Plan: play Mountain, chip in with the Forest 2/2 (Bear is tapped so it can't block; worst case it trades into The Earth King which kills their tutoring engine), and hold 3+ lands up for Reversal.",
