      "summary": "Turn 6 precombat: Earth Rumble resolved, making my animated Forest a 4/4 (it was already a 2/2 from Toph's earlier earthbend). The fight trigger is on the stack with my Forest (p11) as my creature. Opponent's board: Aang 3/2 flying (summoning sick), Mai 1/3 with a double-strike counter (tapped), The Earth King 2/2 — all their lands tapped. I'm targeting Aang: it's a 3-power flyer I can't block (my Seeker is exiled) with lifelink potential off Lessons. Forest (4 power) kills Aang (2 toughness) and survives the 3 damage on 4 toughness. After this I'll weigh attacking — Forest will have 3 damage marked, so an Earth King block would kill it, but the earthbent land returns tapped on death. Zuko is now castable via Mountain + White Lotus Hideout's {1},{T} ability.",
