        {
          "name": "choose_action",
          "arguments": "{\"blockers\":\"p16:p7\",\"summary\":\"Opponent (18hp) attacked with only Mai, Jaded Edge 1/3 (double strike counter) again — unblocked it would deal 2 to me. My animated Forest 4/4 is tapped but Zuko 2/3 is untapped. Blocking with Zuko: Mai deals 1 first-strike + 1 regular = 2 to Zuko (survives on 3 toughness), Zuko deals 2 back to Mai (survives on 3 toughness), and I take 0. This saves 2 life, which matters since Zuko's trigger drains me 2 life/turn. If they have burn, Zuko died regardless; if they pump Mai, a double-strike pump to my face would be far worse than losing Zuko to a chump-block line. From next turn on, my untapped 4/4 Forest handles Mai on defense permanently.\"}",
        }
