        {
          "name": "choose_action",
          "arguments": "{\"summary\": \"My all-in attack connected: Forest 4/4 and Zuko 3/4 hit for 7 (opponent 14→7), and they triple-blocked Rough Rhino Cavalry with Mai, Great Divide Guide, and Sandbender Scavengers. The Rhino dies to the 5 damage coming back regardless. Assigning lethal to Mai (3 damage to the 1/3 double-striker, removing their scariest scaling threat) and to Scavengers (2 damage to the 2/2 — at power 2 its death trigger can't reanimate Aang or Earth King from their graveyard). Guide survives as dead weight for an opponent with 12 lands and no cards in hand.\", \"amounts\": [3, 0, 2]}",
