      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "Opponent's turn 10 precombat: they cast Lightning Strike targeting my Firebending Student (1/2) with Mai's prowess on the stack. My Forest 4/4 and Zuko 3/4 are still tapped from my turn-9 attack, so if Student dies I have NO blockers vs Mai 2/4 double-strike + Guide 2/3 = 6 unblocked damage, putting me to 2 life where my own mandatory Zuko trigger (lose 2 life) would kill me next turn. I'm cracking my Clue Token in response, paying {2} with Mountain + White Lotus Hideout (keeping both blue sources + Forests untapped in case I draw a counterspell/removal), hoping to draw an instant that saves the Student as a blocker or removes an attacker.",
